    "We are pleased to inform you that your budget request has been <strong>approved</strong> by the college. The Finance Office will process the disbursement based on the approved budget.": "የበጀት ጥያቄዎ በኮሌጁ <strong>መጽደቁን</strong> ስናሳውቅዎ ደስ ይለናል። የፋይናንስ ጽሕፈት ቤቱ በጸደቀው በጀት መሠረት ክፍያውን ያስፈጽማል።",
    "We regret to inform you of the outcome.": "ውጤቱን ስናሳውቅዎ እናዝናለን።",
